atom_style      granular
atom_modify     map array
boundary        f f f
newton          off
communicate     single vel yes
units           si
soft_particles  yes
region          domain block -8.000000e-03 8.000000e-03 -8.000000e-03 8.000000e-03 -6.500000e-03 1.692465e-02 units box
create_box      2 domain
neighbor        2.1250e-04 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0

fix m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 2.0000e+05 2.0000e+05
fix m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3 0.3
fix m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 2 0.5 0.5 0.5 0.5
fix m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 2 0.5 0.4 0.4 0.4
fix m5 all property/global coefficientRollingFriction peratomtypepair 2 0.3 0.3 0.3 0.3

pair_style gran model hertz tangential history  rolling_friction epsd2
pair_coeff * *
timestep 2.0557e-05
fix gravi all gravity 9.81 vector 0.0 0.0 -1.0

fix pts1 all particletemplate/sphere 15485863 atom_type 1 density constant 2165.0 radius constant 1.805000e-04
fix pts2 all particletemplate/sphere 15485867 atom_type 1 density constant 2165.0 radius constant 2.125000e-04
fix pts3 all particletemplate/sphere 32452843 atom_type 1 density constant 2165.0 radius constant 2.445000e-04
fix pdd  all particledistribution/discrete/numberbased 49979687 3 pts1 0.3 pts2 0.4 pts3 0.3

fix funnel all mesh/surface file funnel.stl type 2 curvature_tolerant yes
fix outlet all mesh/surface/planar file outlet.stl type 2
fix walls all wall/gran model hertz tangential history  rolling_friction epsd2 mesh n_meshes 1 meshes funnel
fix plug all wall/gran model hertz tangential history  rolling_friction epsd2 primitive type 2 zplane -3.200000e-03
region fillreg cylinder z 0. 0. 6.600000e-03 1.022465e-02 1.562465e-02 units box
fix ins all insert/pack seed 86028157 distributiontemplate pdd insert_every once overlapcheck yes all_in yes particles_in_region 5000 region fillreg ntry_mc 20000
fix integr all nve/sphere
fix mf all massflow/mesh mesh outlet vec_side 0. 0. -1. count once delete_atoms yes
variable t equal time
variable mout equal f_mf[1]
variable nout equal f_mf[2]
variable n equal atoms
thermo_style custom step time atoms f_mf[1] ke
thermo 2432
thermo_modify lost ignore norm no flush yes
fix logmf all print 97 "${t} ${mout} ${nout} ${n}" file outflow.txt screen no
dump dmp all custom 973 dump/p.*.txt id type radius x y z vx vy vz
run 12161
unfix plug
print "PHASE open t=${t}"
run 29187
